This was my 4th build based on the iconic proCoRat.

The heart of this circuit is the LM308 opAmp that is the main source of distortion in the circuit. The second source are the clipping diodes.
I wanted to make the circuit more interesting so as my clipping diodes I gave the red LED's a try. The effect? The eyes of the rat on my enclosure glow
while playing. My favourite build so far.

For this project I will share:
- 3D enclosure design
- audio demo
- build demo
